.TH MERGEON 1 "" "Mergeon" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mergeon \- desktop Git client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mergeon
[\fIREPOSITORY\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Mergeon is a graphical Git client. Each
.I REPOSITORY
argument is a path to a local Git repository that is opened in its own tab
when the application starts.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B APP_UPDATE_FEED_URL
URL of the update feed (a directory that serves the
.I latest*.yml
manifests and the installers). Without it the application does not check for
updates.
.TP
.B MERGEON_USER_DATA_DIR
Directory used for settings instead of the default profile.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/Mergeon/
Settings, recent repositories and session.
